# The Sidecar

From the Bartender

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 oz (60 ml) [Brandy]{ ing="brandy" }
- [ ] 10oz (30 ml) [Cointreau]{ ing="cointreau" }
- [ ] 1/2 oz (5 ml) [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }

## Recipe

1. Combine in a shaker over ice
1. Shake until well mixed
1. Strain and serve in a cocktail glass

## Notes

1. Also see the variant from the Cocktail Codex
